# Ghidra install. Third-party binaries, hundreds of megabytes, and
# reproducible from the NSA release page - the version and SHA-256 are
# pinned in ADR-023 and the runner verifies them before use. These were
# committed by mistake at M9 and stripped from history: GitHub rejects
# any file over 100 MB, so the repository could not be pushed at all.
ghidra/
